          "instagramCaption": "Nobody remembers your founding story. They remember the transformation they got to be part of.\n\nHere is the simple step-by-step breakdown:\n\n01 // Your brand needs to tell a story.\n02 // Most brands tell a story about themselves.\n03 // The 10-Minute Origin Pitch Trap\n04 // The story that actually sells isn't about your history.\n05 // Most 'brand stories' skip the tension entirely.\n06 // Nobody remembers your founding story.\n07 // The 3-Step Story Engine\n08 // Want a brand story people actually see themselves in?\n\n---\n💾 SAVE this post so you have the formulas for your next project.\n✈️ SHARE with a friend or creator who needs this.\n👇 Drop \"STORY\" in the comments and I will instantly DM you the complete free interactive playbook & prompt templates!\n\nproject\\ciel // BEYOND THE FRAME, INTO FEELING.",
