          "prompt": "Use this image as reference to create a graphic carousel slide in the EXACT same visual style, replacing all copy with the following slide content:\n\n=== [REFERENCE STYLE SPECIFICATION] ===\n• Style Name: Ciel Auteur Cinematic Storytelling\n• Genre: Auteur Photographic Storytelling & Narrative Carousels\n• Background: Full-bleed 4:5 rich authentic 35mm film photography: vibrant lifestyle/travel scenes (striped umbrellas, vintage Mediterranean light), everyday surrealist street moments (subway car, rain-soaked asphalt), luxury tactile product macros in use, simple relatable moments of tension and creative effort (messy desk with steaming coffee, hands typing late at night, pouring morning espresso), organic cowhide texture, and diverse global lifestyle settings (modern loft studios, gallery terraces, Tokyo cafes).\n• Header & Navigation: Pure minimalism: Zero fake UI frames, zero , zero box containers. Clean crisp white text floating directly over the photographic negative space.\n• Typography Hierarchy: Playfair Display + Lato Photographic Narrative Hierarchy:\n• Slides 1 & 6 (Hook & Climax): Massive stacked high-contrast Playfair Display Serif in pure crisp white (#FFFFFF) with tight line-height.\n• Slides 2, 3, 4, 7 (Story & Narrative Body): Clean, modern Lato sans-serif in pure white, placed top-left or bottom-left with natural line breaks.\n• Slide 5 (Tension & Stakes): Lato body copy paired with a Playfair Display Serif punchline.\n• Spacing & Punctuation: Natural editorial rhythm with deliberate commas and zero artificial container boxes.\n• Color Palette & Containers: Authentic 35mm photographic palettes: Mediterranean cobalt blue & candy stripes, moody urban subway teal & charcoal, warm amber rain coat, rich cognac crocodile leather, tactile brown-and-white cowhide, and golden sunset amber, text: #FFFFFF pure crisp white text overlay, colors: Natural photographic negative space contrast, High-contrast Playfair serif punchlines\n•  & Accents: Zero , zero clip art, zero geometric blobs. Pure auteur photographic authority where the photograph carries the emotion and the typography delivers the narrative.\n• Lighting & Finish: Authentic 35mm film stock, natural sunlight, warm directional golden hour light, rain-streaked glass refractions, and real tactile material textures.\n\n=== [AUTEUR PHOTOGRAPHIC STORYTELLING DIRECTIVE (COPIED FROM REFERENCE CAROUSEL)] ===\n• Slide 4 Scene Archetype (Tactile Product Macro in Use): Extreme macro photography of a high-end luxury fashion/beauty product or tactile tech device in active use (e.g. viscous golden serum dispensing from a glass pipette with micro-bubbles, hands adjusting a knurled titanium dial on a minimalist audio/computing device, fluted perfume bottle catching sharp morning refraction caustics, or fingers feeling the tactile weave of tailored cashmere/wool). Rich physical resistance, micro-texture, authentic 35mm film grain.\n• Slide 4 Typography: Crisp white Lato sans-serif text blocks positioned top and bottom over the textured background.\n\n=== [SLIDE 4 VARIATION CONTENT] ===\nSlide Purpose: Slide 4 of 8 (STEP2)\nCard Counter Tag: \"04 // 08\"\nTop Pill Badge: \"SECRET 2\"\nMain Headline: \"The story that actually sells isn't about your history.\"\nHighlight Focus: Emphasize keywords \"before and after, transformation\" in the reference style container\nSubtitle / Description: \"It is a before and after transformation map.\"\nBody Points:\n  1. \"Who someone was before they discovered you\"\n  2. \"Who they become after they experience your product\"\n  3. \"Every marketing touchpoint must sit somewhere on that line\"\nCallout Box: \"TRANSFORMATION FORMULA: Before State (Frustrated & Stuck) → After State (Empowered & Transformed).\"\nBottom Prompt: \"THE MISSING INGREDIENT →\"\n\n=== [OUTPUT SPECIFICATIONS] ===\nAspect Ratio: 4:5 vertical portrait (1080x1350) for Instagram Carousel.\nQuality: Ultra-sharp typography, perfect spelling, crisp vector 